[prin-00001] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: [rb-prin-07] :: Distinguish between 'data processing' (which can be verified via console output) and 'artifact generation' (which requires the creation of a persistent, formatted file). When an artifact is requested, the code must act as a factory for that file, ensuring the final output is the file itself, not a demonstration of the logic.
